    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30646" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγχῠτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>poured in, infused</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CD</u>
				2.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγχυτον, τό</span>, <i>injection</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.582
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγχυτος</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλακοῦς</span>), ὁ, <i>cake cast
				into a shape</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hippon.
				37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				518.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Euang.
				1.7
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχῠτοῦς</span></b> , ὁ,
			<u>Gloss.</u>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγχυτον, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγχυμα</span>
			, <i>infusion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				2.10
			</span></i>.</div>
